WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:04.640
Ah, lo siento.

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:05.680
I'm sorry.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:12.120
Finally, I was starting to think

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.400
he wouldn't show up.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:15.520
I told you he would come.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:16.840
Stand here.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:19.240
Michael.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:20.520
Hey.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:23.320
What the hell is going on?

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:24.480
Where did you bring me?

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:25.920
You'll see soon enough.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:27.240
Your only job is

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:28.520
to stand here,

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:31.200
smile, and stay quiet.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.440
Give me your hand.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:39.720
Dr. Ramirez, you can start now.

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:40.840
Thank you.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.840
Today is a big day

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:47.320
for our hospital.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.080
Henderson & Sons

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:51.680
is kindly investing

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:53.480
twenty-five million

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:54.600
in research

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:57.040
on incurable forms of lymphoma

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:04.760
My gratitude is endless.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.360
Words almost fail me.

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:09.680
I'd like to hand over the floor

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:11.440
to the founder and chairman

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:13.040
of our benefactors.

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:14.520
Please welcome

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:17.040
Mr. Richard Henderson.

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:22.400
Dad.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:24.280
Dad?

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:26.520
Thank you.

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:28.560
I assure you,

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:31.000
this is a long term commitment.

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:32.760
We're in this together

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:34.440
for decades to come.

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:36.680
That's why it's so important to me

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:39.040
that my family is here today.

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:41.320
My wife Sharon

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:43.400
my oldest son with his wife

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:45.120
and children,

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:49.160
and my youngest with his fiancée

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:51.160
Fiancée?
